      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have type 2 diabetes and i started taking this new herbal supplement called \"Gluco-Balance\" a couple days ago. since then im feeling super thirsty like i cant drink enough water and i feel like i have to pee every 20 mins. is this just the supplement making me dehydrated or something??",
